==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 450 seconds<sup>13,500f</sup>, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 450 seconds<sup>13,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ms. Sign]]s spawn after 300 seconds<sup>9,000f</sup>, delay 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 32~48 seconds<sup>960f~1,440f</sup>.
**5 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 40~56 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,680f</sup>.
**5 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn, delay 12~24 seconds<sup>360f~720f</sup>.
**10 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.
**5 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 12~24 seconds<sup>360f~720f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Like in [[Chubby B. Goode]], any units that outrange/snipe Camelle can make the stage a lot easier, and this strategy will focus on this.

At the start of the battle, stall for money, which should be easy if you have all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from at least one chapter of [[Cats of the Cosmos]]; otherwise you could try sending a [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Marine Cat]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] to kill some UltraBaaBaas. After getting a max [[Worker Cat]] and money, spam everything but the [[Cat Combo|Combo]] units (if using any) and Space Marine Cats (you should have only 1 or 2 of them out, to not kill all the Metal Hippoes and UltraBaaBaas), and you will eventually win.

==Trivia==
*Murmuring Evil's Japanese name, Gessori Seiakusetsu (ゲッソリ性悪説, "Emaciated Theory of Fundamental Evil), is the opposite of [[Chubby B. Goode]]'s Japanese name, Potchari Seizensetsu (ぽっちゃり性善説, "Chubby Theory of Fundamental Kindness").

